            "\\title{\\textit{Connect, Collapse, Corrupt:} Learning \\\\ Cross-Modal Tasks with Uni-Modal Data}\n",
            "\n",
            "\\author{Yuhui Zhang\\thanks{Equal contribution. Project page available at \\url{https://yuhui-zh15.github.io/C3-Website/}.}~~, Elaine Sui$^*$, Serena Yeung-Levy \\\\\n",
            "Stanford University\\\\\n",
