            "In Section~\\ref{sec:gap} and~\\ref{sec:misalignment}, we explain the modality gap $\\vc_\\perp$ and alignment noise $\\vepsilon$ in Proposition~\\ref{prop:geometry}, respectively. Combining them together, we explain the geometric relation of paired embeddings $\\ve_x - \\ve_y = \\vc_\\perp + \\vepsilon$. \n",
